---
const stripeLink = "https://buy.stripe.com/bJe6oG4ea1codbO2FDa7C0e";
---

<section class="py-48 bg-[#FF5F7E] text-[#0F172A] relative overflow-hidden border-t-4 border-black">

  <!-- Background Accent -->
  <svg class="absolute -bottom-10 right-0 w-[600px] opacity-30 pointer-events-none -z-10"
       viewBox="0 0 600 300" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M20 200 C140 40, 260 260, 420 80 S580 200, 590 40"
          stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"
          class="animate-scribble-final" />
  </svg>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 text-center">

    <!-- Headline -->
    <h2 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[0.9] mb-10">
      Ready to launch faster?<br />
      <span class="inline-block -rotate-1 px-3 bg-[#0F172A] text-white">
        Start with a real SaaS foundation.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Subheadline -->
    <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#0F172A]/90 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-snug mb-16">
      Skip the boilerplate. Skip the wiring. Skip the repetitive setup.  
      Astro SaaS Launcher gives you a fully‑working SaaS starter application with Supabase fully integrated —  
      Auth, Database, Storage, Realtime, RLS, billing, dashboard, and protected routes.  
      It runs out of the box and saves you weeks or months of development time.
    </p>

    <!-- CTA Button -->
    <a href={stripeLink}
       class="inline-block text-center w-full md:w-auto px-20 py-6 text-4xl font-black bg-[#0F172A] text-white border-4 border-black shadow-[10px_10px_0_0_#000] hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0F172A] transition">
      Buy Now – £99
    </a>

    <!-- Micro‑copy -->
    <p class="mt-8 text-xl font-medium text-[#0F172A]/80">
      One‑time payment. Lifetime updates. 14‑day guarantee.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes scribble-final {
    0% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; transform: translateY(0px); }
    50% { stroke-dashoffset: -100; transform: translateY(-10px); }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; transform: translateY(0px); }
  }

  .animate-scribble-final {
    animation: scribble-final 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
</style>

